rialism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"materialism","sort_order":1,"sense":"物質主義","alt_zh":"高中生討論小說，桌上插畫呈現成年角色選擇陪朋友而非追逐豪華物品，無文字。","example":"The novel questioned materialism through a character who valued friendship more than wealth.","example_zh":"小說透過重友情勝於財富的角色，質疑物質主義。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/materialism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-matrix-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"matrix","sort_order":1,"sense":"矩陣","alt_zh":"高中數學老師在桌上以整齊矩形網格排列彩色計數片，學生觀察列行結構，無數字。","example":"The class represented the matrix with rows and columns of colored counters.","example_zh":"班上用彩色計數片的橫列與直行表示矩陣。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/matrix-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mayhem-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mayhem","sort_order":1,"sense":"混亂","alt_zh":"風停後安全校園活動桌上的紙飾散落，高中志工驚訝整理，無危急或受傷。","example":"A sudden gust created mayhem among the paper decorations.","example_zh":"突來陣風讓紙裝飾亂成一團。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mayhem-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-mediation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"mediation","sort_order":1,"sense":"調解","alt_zh":"成年老師在圓桌平靜協調兩組高中社團代表，雙方終於友善握手。","example":"The clubs resolved their disagreement through mediation.","example_zh":"社團透過調解解決分歧。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/mediation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-membrane-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"membrane","sort_order":1,"sense":"膜","alt_zh":"大學展示桌上擺著不透明彩色塑膠細胞模型，藍色外層細胞膜清楚包覆內部構造，畫面只有教具。","example":"The model showed a membrane surrounding the cell.","example_zh":"模型展示包圍細胞的膜。","image_url":"https://jbs